            <div>
              <div class="mb-6 text-left">
                <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400 font-bold block mb-1">Mombasa, Kenya · Konastone Autos &amp; Imports</span>
                <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Konastone Autos and Imports</h3>
                <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-400 font-light max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
                  Find quality cars for sale in Mombasa. Browse available cars, compare prices, mileage and vehicle details, then contact our team to arrange a viewing.
                </p>
              </div>

              {/* Browser mockup */}
              <div class="relative bg-slate-900 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl aspect-[16/9] w-full group">
